        "3330 - وَ قَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : فِي قَوْلِ اَللَّهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ: ۝ وَ مَنْ يَكْتُمْهٰا فَإِنَّهُ آثِمٌ قَلْبُهُ ۝\nقَالَ \"كَافِرٌ قَلْبُهُ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.3330 - And Imam (as) said regarding the saying of Allah (swt), the Almighty and Glorious: \"And whoever conceals it, then indeed his heart is sinful\" (Surah Al-Baqarah 2:283)\nImam (as) said: \"His heart is disbelieving.\""
        ]
